    ],
    "note": "The **coast** is the land along the sea, seen as an area or as a line on a map: *a town on the coast*. The **shore** is the land right at the edge of the water, of a sea or a lake: *we walked along the shore*. A **beach** is an area of sand or small stones by the water where people go to relax: *lie on the beach*."
  },
